# colrpick, the library's ColorDialog as a command: the red, green and blue sliders at its left (41, 56 and 71 across, their tracks from 60
# to 240 down) are dragged up from black, and Return (Okay, the default button) writes the chosen colour's value on standard output and ends
# the program by itself
drag 1 41 240 41 90
wait
drag 1 56 240 56 160
wait
drag 1 71 240 71 60
wait
move 120 150
key Return
